        directions:["From Shinkyogoku shopping arcade, find the narrow Nakano-cho alley (SOU・SOU street signs mark it).","The shops are colour-coded by line: tabi (footwear), kikoromo (clothing), isemomen (cotton), hotei (bags)…","Start at the tabi shop; the staff map the rest."],
