        why:"A Michelin Bib Gourmand okonomiyaki house running since 1945 — about 20 counter seats around the griddle. Seafood-or-vegetable pancakes for Mica, pork-or-mixed for Dad, cooked in front of you: the perfect two-diet dinner.",
